      "sourceTextSha256": "4abaecda3a719eb917512f9225da47bc9dfbb32b1a3de362aee63b420235c2df",
      "text": "Day 4 · Breakfast and transfer to the station for the train to the lost world in the mountains of Peru. Long hidden from view, Machu Picchu was brought to international attention by an American explorer in 1911; it was abandoned by the Incas for reasons still unknown. The beauty of the mountains, the depth of the canyon and the lush greenery make you feel part of a centuries-old mystery. After the guided visit, free time for photos, perhaps with a llama; then bus down to the village for lunch at a Peruvian restaurant, and return by train to Cusco.",
